# Ignore everything in this directory
#
# This is a RUNTIME directory: NgVeri's d_cosim flow writes <model>.xml here
# every time a user adds a Verilog model, and the Remove Models dialog reads
# it back as the source of truth for what is installed. Nothing here is
# authored content, so nothing here belongs in a commit -- a stray `git add`
# ships one developer's local models to every user of the release.
*
# Except this file
!.gitignore
